#: ../../how-to/case-studies/case_dttxml_calibration.ipynb:10002
#: 502b04555ede4cddbd1f565d2cd243d0
msgid "Reading and Using DTT XML Files with gwexpy"
msgstr "gwexpy で DTT XML ファイルを読み込む"

#: ../../how-to/case-studies/case_dttxml_calibration.ipynb:10004
#: 3920b441883b43d19d29699ee1cbc6a7
msgid ""
"[DTT (Diagnostic Tool for Transfer functions)](https://dtt.ligo.org/) is the"
" standard measurement tool used at gravitational-wave detector sites to "
"acquire transfer functions, power spectral densities, and coherence "
"functions. Measurement results are saved as **DTT XML** files."
msgstr ""
"[DTT（Diagnostic Tool for Transfer functions）](https://dtt.ligo.org/)は、 "
"重力波検出器サイトで標準的に使われる伝達関数測定ツールです。 測定結果は **DTT XML** ファイルとして保存されます。"

#: ../../how-to/case-studies/case_dttxml_calibration.ipynb:10009
#: a224ae11f7fc4e0387159fb35c141304
msgid "This tutorial shows how to:"
msgstr "このチュートリアルでは以下を学びます："

#: ../../how-to/case-studies/case_dttxml_calibration.ipynb:10010
#: a230654f10c8456e8d62b1fc3ec8aab1
msgid ""
"Inspect channels stored in a DTT XML file with `extract_xml_channels()`"
msgstr "`extract_xml_channels()` でファイル内のチャネルを確認する"

#: ../../how-to/case-studies/case_dttxml_calibration.ipynb:10011
#: 15a4c18dd3af4aea9567f5ec3fe4c02a
msgid "Load all measurement products with `load_dttxml_products()`"
msgstr "`load_dttxml_products()` で全測定量を読み込む"

#: ../../how-to/case-studies/case_dttxml_calibration.ipynb:10012
#: 387e9d8417e144f78a7850a30141ef17
msgid "Visualise a **Bode plot** (magnitude + phase) and **coherence**"
msgstr "**Bode プロット**（振幅・位相）と**コヒーレンス**を可視化する"

#: ../../how-to/case-studies/case_dttxml_calibration.ipynb:10013
#: 69ab09085750405195aafc782e94a651
msgid "Fit a resonant-system model to the transfer function"
msgstr "gwexpy のフィッティング機能で共振パラメータを推定する"

#: ../../how-to/case-studies/case_dttxml_calibration.ipynb:10015
#: e8561bc180e645f29cd028041bb8d9b5
msgid ""
"This notebook complements `case_transfer_function.ipynb`, which demonstrates"
" TF estimation from raw time series.  Here the data is already the *result* "
"of a measurement saved by DTT."
msgstr ""
"`case_transfer_function.ipynb`（時系列から伝達関数を推定するチュートリアル）の 発展版として、**DTT "
"が出力した測定済み結果**を直接扱うワークフローを示します。"

#: ../../how-to/case-studies/case_dttxml_calibration.ipynb:20002
#: 19afb5fc0f10409bbc71c966871aaa1d
msgid "Setup"
msgstr "準備"

#: ../../how-to/case-studies/case_dttxml_calibration.ipynb:40002
#: 971537ccf2684ed69e1dd5cbed6e09b1
msgid "1. Create a Synthetic DTT XML File"
msgstr "1. 合成 DTT XML ファイルの作成"

#: ../../how-to/case-studies/case_dttxml_calibration.ipynb:40004
#: 55d6a9470543429a889e205027bc7847
msgid ""
"A real workflow starts from an existing `.xml` file produced by DTT. For "
"reproducibility we generate a synthetic file that mimics the structure of "
"real KAGRA suspension transfer-function measurements."
msgstr "実際の運用では既存の `.xml` ファイルを使いますが、 ここでは KAGRA 懸架系の伝達関数測定を模した合成ファイルを生成します。"

